Roti Seri Bakery Inventory System

A web-based inventory management system for a bakery, built with PHP and MySQL. It supports three user roles (Admin, Inventory Manager and Staff), each with its own dashboard and permissions.

Features
Admin
Add, edit, view and delete user accounts
Reset and manage user passwords
View system activity logs
Personal profile and password change
Inventory Manager
Manage products and stock levels
Record and track supplier purchases (view details, print, export)
View sales reports
Export products and activity logs
View order details
Dashboard overview
Staff
Manage inventory (view and update stock)
View suppliers
Receive low-stock alerts and notifications
Personal profile
General
Secure login and logout with role-based access
"Forgot password" flow with email (SMTP) support
Notification system with read/unread status
Tech Stack
Backend: PHP
Database: MySQL / MariaDB
Frontend: HTML, CSS, JavaScript
Dependencies: managed with Composer (e.g. for sending email)
